# cards: a lost battle gives no card and no recharge (docs/plan-cards.md 2.6, point 7). First temple battle,
# party2_strong: round 1 both Fight (some monsters die), then the party's battle HP (Jian 0x0228E874, Lucia
# 0x0228E8E0) is pinned to 0 so the battle is lost. Expect: the Bealzebub (bag 0x0213BA12) and Thanatos (0x0213BA25)
# cards stay at 0; the battle result (s16 at 0x020B85C4) shows a loss. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
wait 270
watch u8 0x0213ba12 bealzebub_cards
watch u8 0x0213ba25 thanatos_cards
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
watch u16 0x020B85C4 result
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 3000
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
pin u32 0x0228E874 0
pin u32 0x0228E8E0 0
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 900
shot cl_end
